---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Remove Blur Online"
  description="Remove Blur Online privacy policy. All image processing happens locally in your browser. No photos are uploaded, stored, or shared. 100% client-side and private."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[#ebebeb] bg-white text-[12px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#8f8f8f] shadow-whisper mx-auto mb-6">
      Privacy Policy
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-6 leading-tight">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[15px] sm:text-lg text-[#4d4d4d] max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Last updated: October 27, 2026
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          1. Who We Are
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Remove Blur Online (removebluronline.com) is a free, browser-based photo unblurring tool. We sharpen blurry photos,
          portraits, documents, and images directly on your device — no cloud uploads, no accounts, and no watermarks.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          2. Client-Side Processing — Your Photos Stay on Your Device
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          All sharpening runs locally in your web browser using HTML5 Canvas. When you upload or paste a photo into Remove Blur
          Online, the image data never leaves your device. It is never transmitted over the internet, never saved on external
          servers, and never reviewed by any person or third party. Because processing is 100% client-side, your photos remain
          private and confidential.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          3. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Remove Blur Online does not require you to create an account, provide an email address, or share any personal
          information. We do not collect photos, metadata, or usage profiles from your device. Standard, anonymous technical
          information (such as browser type and referrer) may be processed by our hosting provider for security and operations,
          but it is not linked to you or your images.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          4. No Storage, No Sharing, No Sale
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We do not store your photos, we do not share them with anyone, and we do not sell data of any kind. Once you close the
          tab or navigate away, the processed result exists only in your browser session unless you choose to download it to your
          own device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          5. Cookies and Tracking
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Remove Blur Online does not set tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or analytics cookies tied to your identity. The
          site functions without cookies, and no personal data is collected for marketing or profiling purposes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          6. Children's Privacy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Our service is available to users of all ages and does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone. Because no
          personal information or photos are collected at all, there is nothing to restrict or delete.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          7. Your Rights
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Since we do not collect, store, or transmit your photos or personal data, there is nothing for you to access, correct,
          export, or delete. If you have questions about this policy, contact us using the details on our
          <a href="/contact-us" class="text-[#0070f3] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#0761d1] transition-colors">Contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.04em] mb-4 leading-tight">
          8. Changes to This Policy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We may update this privacy policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the most recent change.
          Continued use of Remove Blur Online after any updates means you accept the revised policy.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-[#ebebeb] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-[#8f8f8f]">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#171717] text-white text-[14px] font-medium shadow-whisper hover:bg-black transition-all active:scale-[0.98]"
      >
        ← Back to Unblur Tool
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
